{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111090","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111090/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111090/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111090/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111090","id":3470884269,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rafPH","number":111090,"title":"GDExtension: Prevent breaking compatibility for unexposed classes that can only be created once","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-30T19:54:41Z","updated_at":"2025-10-06T15:02:34Z","closed_at":"2025-10-02T20:17:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111090","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111090","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111090.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111090.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-02T20:17:21Z"},"body":"In PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440 we changed `ClassDB::instantiate()` to prevent creating classes that are unexposed.\r\n\r\nThis was an important bug fix, as this was never intended to work generally - only the editor should be able to create internal classes in a handful of limited circumstances (like editor plugins).\r\n\r\nHowever, this broke compatibility for some GDExtensions, so we did PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108614 to allow old GDExtensions that depended on this old behavior to continue to work. It worked by making unexposed classes from old GDExtensions not actually be marked as unexposed (so they could still be created via `ClassDB::instantiate()`), but unexposed classes from new GDExtensions would truly be unexposed. At the time, I couldn't think of a way that unexposed classes being exposed could break anything; just that they'd clutter up lists, and users would have to ignore them.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, it turns out that this [broke other extensions](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108614#issuecomment-3335505455) which depended on nothing except for the extension itself being able to create the internal class. And, the editor will attempt to create an instance of each exposed class at startup to get its property defaults, potentially causing a crash at editor startup. :-/\r\n\r\nSo, this PR basically rolls back PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108614, and takes a new approach to preserving compatibility in that case: it adds a special flag for unexposed classes from old GDExtensions, and makes it so those can still be created via `ClassDB::instantiate()` like they used to (before Godot 4.5-stable).\r\n\r\nThis is less \"clean\" because we have this special flag just for this purpose, but it is the most targeted change to behavior that I can think of, so hopefully this won't break anything else :-)\r\n\r\nGiven that this compatibility break is in Godot 4.5-stable, I think it's really only worth doing this change if we can get it into Godot 4.5.1 (or another 4.5.x patch release)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111090/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111090/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}